atlas optimization-decision-program

architecture decision-program
  canonical_name DecisionProgram
  owns BoundedDecisionQuestion
  owns DecisionAssessment
  consumes ExactCandidateSet
  consumes AdmittedSourceDescriptor
  publishes DiagnosticReviewQueue
  family optimization
  domain Optimization / typed model decisions
  layer execution
  semantic_question Can a typed, joint multi-question model reduce human review work on an exact candidate set without becoming source truth or effect authority?
  purpose Compile bounded state and CUE-authored choice, score and noul questions into a model request; validate the returned distribution, preserve request and response digests, compare models on exactly the same descriptor, and leave disagreement or uncertainty for an operator.
  maturity implemented
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/decision-program-plane.cue
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/decision_program_plane.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/typed-decision.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/installed-runtime.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreDecision/local-inference.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/decision_program_plane.test.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/results/clef-first-live-probe.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/results/clef-scale-assessment.json
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/decision_program_plane.test.mjs proves source-indexed string questions, typed distribution validation, bounded Clef and Clef-flash requests, receipt-bound model comparison and refusal of mismatched sources or an effecting row
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/source_fabric_cycle_impact.test.mjs proves the Source Fabric cycle excludes decision experiments and refuses legacy decision options because no avoided work has been measured
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/results/clef-first-live-probe.json records one live request each to Clef and Clef-flash on the same admitted source, distinct response digests, model disagreement, and a retained review outcome; it is not a calibration, accuracy or typical-latency measurement
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/results/clef-scale-assessment.json records a local estate snapshot of admitted and candidate channel volume and retained item volume while identifying zero replaced downstream work in the existing decision program
  invariant the exact owner supplies the finite candidate set; the model neither discovers nor admits a source
  invariant choice, score and noul questions are authored once in CUE and the bounded request carries source-indexed string instructions, not arbitrary JS prompt branches
  invariant a model response must validate against the authored answer shape before it becomes a diagnostic receipt
  invariant ordinary source assessment selects the same pinned local owner and serialized inference lane as ContextCut, MCP and Flow; planning neither loads weights nor requests hosted credentials
  invariant execution requires an explicit total call budget before model startup; hosted retry attempts consume that budget and private source descriptors cannot be overridden by a public batch attestation
  invariant hosted egress requires explicit provider selection and public information classification; source admission and a public-looking address do not imply permission to send descriptors remotely
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/decision_program_plane.test.mjs proves default local and CLI planning without model residency, shared fixture inference and provenance, missing budget refusal, hosted privacy and retry accounting, and score legend validation without effect authority
  invariant a request carries one semantic source with all of its questions; separate source records run through the shared bounded scheduler rather than being fused into Clef joint field attention
  invariant review lanes use option probability rather than provider-specific confidence, and ordered scores retain and validate their complete probability distributions
  invariant the comparison requires identical source descriptors and distinct receipt-bound model responses; disagreement produces operator review, never a vote
  invariant a diagnostic may label or prioritize human review only; source standing, rights, publication, payment and effects remain with their exact owners
  invariant a model diagnostic is not a recurring production step until a named downstream operation, measured baseline, avoided-work count, quality floor, and total cost comparison exist
  forbidden_inference model confidence or model agreement -> exactness, admission, publication or authority
  forbidden_inference one live two-model probe -> domain accuracy, calibration, typical latency, or a cheaper whole-system execution path
  known_gap one live source demonstrates connectivity and guarded consumption, not measured review reduction; no production consumer replaces expensive work today, so the Source Fabric cycle does not invoke this experimental owner
  known_gap the bounded CLI reads Cloudflare account and API token from process environment; the sealed BonfyreCredentials store is not yet its execution boundary
  known_gap ContextCut, MCP and Flow share the runtime and typed probability substrate but retain distinct owner-authored question programs; no cross-domain quality or avoided-work claim follows from shared execution
  known_gap this owner is text-only; the native execution bridge does not establish upstream multimodal support or production quality and cost savings
  interacts source-frontier
  interacts cheap-cognition
  interacts decision-plane
  interacts native-clef-runtime
